00:09:44.229 --> 00:09:45.569
'Cause we were in the kitchen

00:09:45.569 --> 00:09:47.069
and they said there was a mushroom.

00:09:47.069 --> 00:09:48.212
(top-hat crash)

00:09:48.212 --> 00:09:49.962
- [Liz] You stole that off Jordan.

00:09:49.962 --> 00:09:51.601
He said that earlier today.

00:09:51.601 --> 00:09:52.684
Shush, Liz.

00:09:55.456 --> 00:09:56.723
We just had a moment then.

00:09:56.723 --> 00:09:59.149
That wine is lovely with this.

00:09:59.149 --> 00:10:00.360
Zingy salad.

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:02.696
I've never called
anything in my life zingy.

00:10:02.696 --> 00:10:04.707
But, this salad is zingy.

00:10:04.707 --> 00:10:05.698
Do we need bread?

00:10:05.698 --> 00:10:07.639
A big thick petal would be too much.

00:10:07.639 --> 00:10:08.472
You know what?

00:10:08.472 --> 00:10:09.305
I think they nailed it.

00:10:09.305 --> 00:10:10.300
I don't think you need break with this.

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:12.988
The bread here, really, is the goat.

00:10:12.988 --> 00:10:17.150
The goat replaces chilli
sauce, bread, regret.

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:18.564
It's all replaced by goat.

00:10:18.564 --> 00:10:21.458
Honestly, gonna ask for
goat in my next kebab.

00:10:21.458 --> 00:10:22.374
Got any goat?

00:10:22.374 --> 00:10:24.235
What do you mean you don't have any goat?

00:10:24.235 --> 00:10:25.738
What sort of establishment is this?

00:10:25.738 --> 00:10:27.364
How much are your kebabs?

00:10:27.364 --> 00:10:28.382
You're on a throne.
Yep.

00:10:28.382 --> 00:10:31.051
Got this platter of kebab in front of us.

00:10:31.051 --> 00:10:35.218
I think this is, truly, as
royal as a kebab could get.

00:10:36.246 --> 00:10:37.113
Oh my god.

00:10:37.113 --> 00:10:38.270
Yeah.

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:39.632
Worth It Winner Time.

00:10:39.632 --> 00:10:41.378
All the restaurant were incredible

00:10:41.378 --> 00:10:44.379
but we have to decide which
was the most worth it.

00:10:44.379 --> 00:10:46.290
Close runner-up, The Woody Grill.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.100
Very authentic, however, for me,

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:50.028
my Worth It Winner was Le Bab.

00:10:50.028 --> 00:10:52.149
Very tasty, very reasonably priced,

00:10:52.149 --> 00:10:54.344
unique type of kebab there.

00:10:54.344 --> 00:10:56.250
I've never had something like that before.

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:59.677
I loved Hazev and yeah,
Woody Grill was so good.

00:10:59.677 --> 00:11:01.253
But, I have to agree with you.

00:11:01.253 --> 00:11:03.017
Le Bab, that gets my Worth It Winner.

00:11:03.017 --> 00:11:04.837
I never thought I would have loved

00:11:04.837 --> 00:11:06.353
a kebab without meat in it.

00:11:06.353 --> 00:11:07.950
I could eat there everyday.
Yeah.

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:09.442
I loved it.

00:11:09.442 --> 00:11:13.333
There's no real elegant way
to eat a kebab is there?

00:11:13.333 --> 00:11:14.567
I think I'm eating quite elegant.

00:11:14.567 --> 00:11:15.616
Mm, okay.

00:11:15.616 --> 00:11:17.199
Who told you that?

